[755.831851, "o", "xsplit: 0.201 ms\r\ntorch.mm fp16->fp32: NO (Expected out tensor to have dtype c10::Half, but got float i)\r\nswz BM128 BN256 BK64 w8 s2 g8: 11.227 ms err 2.17e-05\r\nswz BM128 BN256 BK64 w8 s2 g4: 11.368 ms err 2.17e-05\r\nswz BM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s3 g8: 2.584 ms err 2.17e-05\r\nswz BM128 BN256 BK32 w8 s3 g8: 14.390 ms err 2.17e-05\r\nswz BM128 BN128 BK32 w8 s4 g8: 2.656 ms err 2.17e-05\r\ninl BM128 BN256 BK64 w8 s2 g8: 16.839 ms err 2.17e-05\r\ninl BM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s3 g8: 2.858 ms err 2.17e-05\r\n"]
