[1144.725408, "o", "pers ws=True BM128 BN128 BK64: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262168, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\npers ws=False BM128 BN128 BK64: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262168, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\npers ws=True BM128 BN128 BK64: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262168, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\npers ws=True BM128 BN256 BK64: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327696, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\npers ws=True BM128 BN256 BK32: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 278552, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\n"]
